Package: astsa
Type: Package
Title: Applied Statistical Time Series Analysis
Version: 2.5.11
Date: 2026-11-15
Maintainer:	David Stoffer <stoffer@pitt.edu>
Author:	David Stoffer [aut, cre], Nicky Poison [ctb, mus, spy]
Authors@R: c(person(given = "David",
                    family = "Stoffer",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "stoffer@pitt.edu"),
             person(given = "Nicky",
                    family = "Poison",
                    role = c("ctb", "mus", "spy")))
Description: Contains data sets and scripts for analyzing time series in both
    the frequency and time domains including state space modeling as well as
    supporting the texts Time Series Analysis and Its Applications: With R
    Examples (5th ed), by R.H. Shumway and D.S. Stoffer. Springer Texts in
    Statistics, 2025, <DOI:10.1007/978-3-031-70584-7>, and Time Series: A
    Data Analysis Approach Using R (2nd ed). Chapman-Hall, 2026, <doi:10.1201/9781003622574>.
    Many scripts are designed to require minimal input to produce aesthetically
    pleasing output for ease of use in live demonstrations and course work.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://dsstoffer.github.io/, https://nickpoison.github.io/
BugReports: https://github.com/nickpoison/astsa/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
LazyLoad: yes
LazyData: yes
